\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asahi_713/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/28ecc211/uploads/origins/2ac42f56-11cb-4961-8fe1-1cb8968df023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=301060dc0c902089d3cf94b4f34d3e20", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/28ecc211/uploads/origins/2ac42f56-11cb-4961-8fe1-1cb8968df023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=301060dc0c902089d3cf94b4f34d3e20, https://si.imgix.net/28ecc211/uploads/origins/2ac42f56-11cb-4961-8fe1-1cb8968df023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8445703f9cba3c71d0fa08fc4fe31114 2x, https://si.imgix.net/28ecc211/uploads/origins/2ac42f56-11cb-4961-8fe1-1cb8968df023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9cfec4c363cc3a1551b48c2b852dd7bf 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "うちのこをえちえちにかいて(  ¯꒳​¯ )ᐝ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asahi_713/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/930667f6/uploads/origins/26a2bc3e-7d3b-4a6e-acf5-9e5c8cb3d6bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a17ae4426eb14f90cffe371e4c88e74a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/930667f6/uploads/origins/26a2bc3e-7d3b-4a6e-acf5-9e5c8cb3d6bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a17ae4426eb14f90cffe371e4c88e74a, https://si.imgix.net/930667f6/uploads/origins/26a2bc3e-7d3b-4a6e-acf5-9e5c8cb3d6bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ab28c50a163ef71b4f0664b0220c193c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/930667f6/uploads/origins/26a2bc3e-7d3b-4a6e-acf5-9e5c8cb3d6bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8cca1295347ca716965aeac5f079d499 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "種族:ミコッテ（ムーンキーパー）\n\n髪型:クラシカルロングヘアー\n\n髪色:ベージュorブラウン\n\n雰囲気:冬らしい感じが出ると嬉しいです！\n（例）少し寒い中待ち合わせしていて